e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NwH2LSxaH7UQ7kNvwFtYOqb&_nc_oc=AdoN_po1IvzxClUXQImbTXNePHvMMopv3YX3EQF9_QFAOra9RIDAhvrh0siwaqBfSNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD1MKPZWHJKl6bGx7KM3BVsy76xAywD1YUndB6nnLdeZg&oe=6A6F5D79"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-Gxj4nrNIrEQ7kNvwG5NRMU&_nc_oc=AdqkAaUr9vcm0ExHYIz9YcOkj6o8Wfxa3sNZgvlmJSY9nPQQZRuysUcSVO2pypTDwXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBauLL0fclnsIuDp2T4Cgonm1LGQBKvygnVzd0IcPxNYg&oe=6A6F34D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T-WZq_g-LYkQ7kNvwFTfAXq&_nc_oc=Ado2USmGqFVc_wItkuEVVftxBnnwSC-8qUfo5GPWctNO5rZrT0f4yTV0V-Z92eZJd98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDMKLSAzOb0alRJJRGdKuaBmUTrgF4sVhNC2V-PHwcbIg&oe=6A6F407B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5zIGCiz2nR0Q7kNvwFRZ8ow&_nc_oc=AdqC86u0W6Exk9EXEsZnZ6XkvSsURpLGn__R47BkuEmJG4bC_8cXRpKSSP8YXOaLF4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCEPv1txTeVEQKRKQVjTAI0wCOKrF9zDHZgrxTX_D0DpA&oe=6A6F41CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8nTVMVOSXhYQ7kNvwG32cXO&_nc_oc=AdqZl5cD15EekSDAPvc31VG_V3pD1cS7LRa1MBebxeB1OWFDbfOWKDDaBmEsd--kAhk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD7pKBCa6_gmF62MVMeTKbVqbvlh6hy55KxdPRXeLsVkQ&oe=6A6F2AFE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se